    "text": "By Jay Edwards ,\n10 hours ago FRANKLIN BOROUGH, N.J. (Sussex County) — A Clayton man was arrested in June after police investigated allegations that he repeatedly failed to scan merchandise at a ShopRite self-checkout in Franklin Borough, according to police. Troy McAlpin, 56, was arrested on the afternoon of June 6 following a shoplifting complaint... Read full article\n9",
